---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Manx One and our sources" description="About Manx One: an independent Isle of Man information service built from official and local public sources.">
  <PageHead title="About & sources" sub="An independent guide to Isle of Man information" icon="info" />
  <div class="wrap narrow prose">
    <p>Manx One brings together public information about the Isle of Man — jobs, property, news, travel, weather, events and local services — so you can find it in one place. It's made independently by Hammer Labs and is not affiliated with the Isle of Man Government or any organisation listed.</p>
    <h2>Where the information comes from</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Jobs:</strong> Isle of Man Government JobCentre and Government vacancies (JobTrain).</li>
      <li><strong>Property:</strong> the public websites of Isle of Man estate agents.</li>
      <li><strong>News:</strong> headlines from Manx Radio, Three FM and other publishers, linking to the original stories.</li>
      <li><strong>Weather:</strong> Ronaldsway Met Office forecasts (gov.im) and Open-Meteo.</li>
      <li><strong>Travel:</strong> Isle of Man Steam Packet, Isle of Man Airport, Isle of Man Bus & Rail, Isle of Man Railways, Visit Isle of Man and the Department of Infrastructure.</li>
      <li><strong>Events:</strong> the Villa Marina & Gaiety, Manx National Heritage, Visit Isle of Man, Erin Arts Centre and approved community submissions.</li>
      <li><strong>Services:</strong> Manx Care, Isle of Man Government departments, local authorities and DESC.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Most information is refreshed automatically several times a day. Always check with the original source before you rely on it — especially for travel, health and deadlines. Each page names its source.</p>
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>The website doesn't need an account. Saved jobs, your bin street and theme choice are kept in your own browser. If you add an event, we store the details you submit so it can be reviewed. Read the <a href="https://hammerthunderr.github.io/iom-jobs-data/privacy.html">privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>Spotted something wrong, or have an idea? Email <a href="mailto:hammerpunch786@gmail.com?subject=Manx%20One%20website">hammerpunch786@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.manxone.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get the Android app</a></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
